    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find who is waiting\n\nRefreshes the stored inbox, waits a minute, then lists the people whose last message you have not answered. Rows with no profile link, or older than your limit, are left out. The HTTP Request nodes need your **Bearer Auth** credential.",
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "2f1ee094-6a55-4d22-95d7-e11d37001cc0",
      "name": "Find who is waiting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Draft and ask, one person at a time\n\nReads the whole conversation, drafts a reply with the chat model, and sends you the draft in Slack with **Send it** and **Skip**. The workflow waits for your answer before it goes on.",
        "width": 880,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3b4c1870-3b85-4b86-9e26-09ba4fccf31c",
      "name": "Draft and ask",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send, then the next person\n\nOnly after **Send it**. The reply goes out from your own LinkedIn account, then the workflow pauses before the next person so the messages are not sent in a burst.",
